3. How to run the project
Open the extracted folder in VS Code.

Step 1: Open terminal and create virtual environment
python -m venv .venv

Step 2: Install required libraries
pip install -r requirements.txt

Step 3: Run the Python program
python main.py

4. Expected output
With the supplied employees.csv, you should get:
Rows read: 5 | High earners written: 3
salary.xlsx created and read back: 5 rows
ERROR - File not found: missing.txt
PDF skipped: place a PDF in this folder or run with --pdf filename.pdf


The error line may appear in a different order because logging uses stderr.
5. PDF extraction
To test the PDF requirement, put a PDF in the project folder and run:
python main.py --pdf sample.pdf


The program extracts page 1 and prints its first 100 characters.